---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="Prashant Shah">
  <section class="pt-12 pb-20">
    <p class="text-[13px] font-medium text-[var(--color-accent)] tracking-wide uppercase mb-4">
      Software Engineer &middot; Researcher
    </p>
    <h1 class="text-[clamp(2.2rem,5vw,3.2rem)] leading-[1.1] mb-6 max-w-[560px]" transition:name="page-title">
      I build software that closes the gap between what systems know and what people need.
    </h1>
    <p class="text-[var(--color-muted)] max-w-[480px] mb-10 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">
      Three internships. Research published at SAM International. CS &amp; Data Science at Ramapo College, graduating May 2026.
    </p>

    <div class="flex gap-3 items-center">
      <a
        href="/resume.pdf"
        class="inline-block text-[13px] font-medium bg-[var(--color-accent)] text-white rounded-md px-5 py-2.5 hover:bg-[var(--color-accent-hover)] transition-colors duration-150"
      >
        Resume
      </a>
      <a
        href="mailto:shahp0021@gmail.com"
        class="inline-block text-[13px] font-medium text-[var(--color-muted)] border border-[var(--color-border)] rounded-md px-5 py-2.5 hover:border-[var(--color-text)] hover:text-[var(--color-text)] transition-colors duration-150"
      >
        Get in touch
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-t border-[var(--color-border)] pt-14 pb-6">
    <h2 class="text-[13px] font-medium text-[var(--color-faint)] tracking-wide uppercase mb-8">Selected Work</h2>

    <div class="space-y-10">
      <a href="/work#canvas-agent" class="group block">
        <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between mb-1">
          <h3 class="text-[17px] font-semibold group-hover:text-[var(--color-accent)] transition-colors">Canvas Agent</h3>
          <span class="text-[12px] text-[var(--color-faint)] font-mono">2026</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[var(--color-muted)] text-[15px] leading-relaxed">
          AI agent with generative UI that builds interface components at runtime from user intent. 9 typed tools, parameterized SQL, persistent memory. Won HackRamapo.
        </p>
      </a>

      <a href="/work#trimble" class="group block">
        <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between mb-1">
          <h3 class="text-[17px] font-semibold group-hover:text-[var(--color-accent)] transition-colors">Trimble</h3>
          <span class="text-[12px] text-[var(--color-faint)] font-mono">2025</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[var(--color-muted)] text-[15px] leading-relaxed">
          Production configuration management platform in C#/.NET and Azure for a distributed broker architecture serving enterprise transportation.
        </p>
      </a>

      <a href="/research" class="group block">
        <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between mb-1">
          <h3 class="text-[17px] font-semibold group-hover:text-[var(--color-accent)] transition-colors">Intent-Content Conflict in Retrieval</h3>
          <span class="text-[12px] text-[var(--color-faint)] font-mono">ongoing</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[var(--color-muted)] text-[15px] leading-relaxed">
          When user intent contradicts content semantics, retrieval breaks. Building a framework to resolve that conflict using knowledge graphs where emotions are first-class entities.
        </p>
      </a>

      <a href="/work#pantry" class="group block">
        <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between mb-1">
          <h3 class="text-[17px] font-semibold group-hover:text-[var(--color-accent)] transition-colors">Center for Food Action</h3>
          <span class="text-[12px] text-[var(--color-faint)] font-mono">2025</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[var(--color-muted)] text-[15px] leading-relaxed">
          Full-stack inventory platform replacing manual tracking across 6 pantries serving 40,000 people annually. Featured in News 12 NJ and Ramapo News.
        </p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-t border-[var(--color-border)] pt-10 pb-4">
    <p class="text-[14px] text-[var(--color-muted)]">
      <span class="font-medium text-[var(--color-text)]">Currently:</span>
      Finishing my capstone on collision risk prediction, extending the Canvas agent into a generative UI system, and looking for full-time roles starting Summer 2026.
      <a href="/now" class="ml-1 text-[var(--color-accent)]">What I'm up to &rarr;</a>
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>
